# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit .env.local.
#
# Get a free key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# This is read ONLY on the server (app/api/itinerary/route.ts). It is never
# exposed to the browser — note the deliberate absence of a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to gemini-3.6-flash.
# Faster/cheaper alternative: gemini-3.1-flash-lite.
# Note that Google retires models for NEW api keys while still listing them on
# the /models endpoint, so an old model id can fail for you and work for someone
# who signed up earlier. If you see "That model isn't available", set a current
# one here.
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.6-flash
